{"id":"52ad543842bcb570","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-conditional-expectation.md","title":"Conditional Expectation","display":"df-conditional-expectation — Conditional Expectation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-conditional-expectation","aliases":["58-df-conditional-expectation"],"display":"df-conditional-expectation — Conditional Expectation","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-conditional-expectation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-conditional-expectation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-conditional-expectation — Conditional Expectation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal G,X,Y\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal G,X,Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P)\\)</span>（完整条件期望谓词，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CondExp}_{\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P}(Y;X,\\mathcal G)\">\\(\\operatorname{CondExp}_{\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P}(Y;X,\\mathcal G)\\)</span>（本文件定义的语境索引记号）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}expectation} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_{\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P}(Y;X,\\mathcal G)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}expectation} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_{\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P}(Y;X,\\mathcal G)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The subscript records the ambient sample space, sigma-algebra, and probability measure instead of hiding truth-relevant structure in a three-place predicate.</li>\n<li>When <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in L^2\">\\(X\\in L^2\\)</span>, conditional expectation is the orthogonal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2\">\\(L^2\\)</span>-projection onto the closed subspace of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G\">\\(\\mathcal G\\)</span>-measurable functions; the upstream definition only requires <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in L^1\">\\(X\\in L^1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Tower property: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{E}[\\mathbb{E}[X \\mid \\mathcal{G}] \\mid \\mathcal{H}] = \\mathbb{E}[X \\mid \\mathcal{H}]\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[\\mathbb{E}[X \\mid \\mathcal{G}] \\mid \\mathcal{H}] = \\mathbb{E}[X \\mid \\mathcal{H}]\\)</span> when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{H} \\subseteq \\mathcal{G}\">\\(\\mathcal{H} \\subseteq \\mathcal{G}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Radon–Nikodym derivative: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{E}[X \\mid \\mathcal{G}] = \\frac{d\\mathbb{Q}}{d\\mathbb{P}}|_{\\mathcal{G}}\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X \\mid \\mathcal{G}] = \\frac{d\\mathbb{Q}}{d\\mathbb{P}}|_{\\mathcal{G}}\\)</span> when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Q} \\ll \\mathbb{P}\">\\(\\mathbb{Q} \\ll \\mathbb{P}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e4ee9615831113b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e4ee9615831113b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P)$（完整条件期望谓词，see [[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal G,X,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CondExp}_{\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P}(Y;X,\\mathcal G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}expectation} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_{\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P}(Y;X,\\mathcal G)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P)","display":true},{"tex":"X\\in L^2","display":false},{"tex":"L^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in L^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{E}[\\mathbb{E}[X \\mid \\mathcal{G}] \\mid \\mathcal{H}] = \\mathbb{E}[X \\mid \\mathcal{H}]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{H} \\subseteq \\mathcal{G}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{E}[X \\mid \\mathcal{G}] = \\frac{d\\mathbb{Q}}{d\\mathbb{P}}|_{\\mathcal{G}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{Q} \\ll \\mathbb{P}","display":false}],"bytes":1551,"backlinks":[{"id":"1212025633f2b50c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CondExp}_S(Y,Z,\\mathcal H,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-conditional-expectation.md]])"},{"id":"5b66d1b59b418b03","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a19d7b6eacb882e0","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(Y,Z,\\mathcal H,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)$ (fully indexed conditional-expectation predicate, see [[58-df-conditional-expectation]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-341","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-conditional-expectation.md|58-df-conditional-expectation]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["2e4ee9615831113b"]}